# Installed by `bootstrap.ts` on first run of `orch` or `watch-pr`.
#
# It is a local artifact, not shipped source: `bun install --frozen-lockfile` rebuilds it from
# `package.json` + `bun.lock`, and the root `.gitignore` already covers `node_modules/`. This
# file exists so the reason is visible to anyone looking at the directory rather than only to
# someone who thinks to run `git check-ignore`.
node_modules/
